 a healthcare facility located in La Rioja, where Dr. Ángela Martín Palmero serves as the head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit. This clinical institution is dedicated to providing specialized care in the fields of clinical nutrition and dietetics, under the expert direction of Dr. Martín Palmero.", "DR. ÁNGELA MARTÍN PALMERO:Director científica and head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital San Pedro.", "DR. JULIA OCÓN BRETÓN:Director científica and head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital Clínico Universitario Lozano Blesa.", "MESA REDONDA DE CASOS CLÍNICOS. NORTE:A round table event discussing clinical cases related to nutrition and diabetes management.", "DIETA TERAPÉUTICA:A specialized diet designed to manage specific health conditions, such as diabetes or cancer.)<|COMPLETE|>", "MIGUEL LEÓN SANZ:Miguel León Sanz is a medical professional specializing in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario 12 de Octubre. He holds the position of President of the Sociedad Española de Nutrición Clínica y Metabolismo (SENPE), where he is actively involved in the fields of clinical nutrition and metabolism.", "SOCIEDAD ESPAÑOLA DE NUTRICIÓN CLÍNICA Y METABOLISMO:The Sociedad Española de Nutrición Clínica y Metabolismo (SENPE) is an organization focused on improving clinical nutrition and metabolism practices in Spain."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}